  (text "OVLO nominal1.2V x(1+374k/100k)=5.688V. Component/leakage corners in protection-calculations.json.\nUVLO divider22.1k/10k: about3.85V nominal. EN is separately clamped, never raw VBUS.\n6.49k ILM: about0.51A protection threshold; BQ charger still sets100mA input budget.\n1nF DVDT: about2V/ms, about2.5ms ramp to5V; measure actual inrush with complete load.\nF1 -> input TVS -> eFuse -> output TVS/ESD reference/charger/sense.\nIndependent cutoff is a circuit provision; response overshoot, CC/data faults and thermal/surge tests remain BLOCKED."
    (at 195 263 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "51173239-339e-5fe8-ab16-598502a7c2be")
